  "doc_id": "01a0742b-8524-77fa-82d5-14970cde8c21",
  "text": "## Template 5: Failed Transaction Notification  \n**Subject:** Your Transfer Failed — Here's Why  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nYour transfer of £[amount] to [recipient] could not be completed.\n\nWhat Happened:\nReason: [Insufficient funds / Invalid account / Account closed / Other]\n\nWhat This Means:\n[Explanation tailored to reason - see below]\n\nNext Steps:\n[Solution tailored to reason - see below]\n\nINSUFFICIENT FUNDS:\nThe transfer failed because your account balance is too low.\n- Current Balance: £[amount]\n- Transfer Amount: £[amount]\n- You need: £[shortfall] more\n\nSolution: Once you deposit enough funds, we can retry this transfer.\nJust reply to this email or call 0800-555-2265 to proceed.\n\nINVALID ACCOUNT:\nThe recipient's account details appear incorrect.\n- Account Number: [number provided]\n\nSolution: Double-check the account number with the recipient and\nreply with the correct details. We'll resubmit immediately.\n\nACCOUNT CLOSED:\nThe recipient's account is no longer active.\n\nSolution: Please contact the recipient to get their current account\ndetails, then we can try again.\n\nQuestions?\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n\nWe're here to help!\n\nFirstUK Bank Team\n```  \n---",
